  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You seize control of spell effects controlled by others</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Spellthief<sup>USoP</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may use the Spellthief feat on all sphere effects, not just those that target a creature or an object. If gaining control of a sphere effect that animates, calls, creates, or summons a creature with an intelligence score, that creature is allowed a Will save equal to your Enhancement sphere DC every round to resist your control.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
